{"title":"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the sequence of numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/1/2a125c95fc172d91247eb10a2aabc8515f3d2eb0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1, 3, 2, \\ldots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"71\" height=\"16\" /> each term after the first two is equal to the term preceding it minus the term preceding that. The sum of the first one hundred terms of the sequence is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/a/c3ad4bca81946dd84cc009bd795313016c45e699.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 5 \\qquad  \\textbf{(B)}\\ 4 \\qquad  \\textbf{(C)}\\ 2 \\qquad  \\textbf{(D)}\\ 1 \\qquad  \\textbf{(E)}\\ -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"370\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, write a few terms of the sequence:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/2/d7205139f99595b20aafe4c5458d2f5a583462a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1, 3, 2, -1, -3, -2, 1, 3, 2, \\ldots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"216\" height=\"16\" />  Notice how the pattern repeats every six terms and every six terms have a sum of 0. Then, find that the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/d/4bd0981e3eb57d1d92899595ddfc1767b7178e0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16*6=96$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"86\" height=\"13\" />th term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/a/62a76677add1d246708c86edfc7c4b8a40184914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> and the sum of the all those previous terms is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Then, write the 97th to the 100th terms down: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/1/261a251a59e1c6982da9d1a129aa4c6a6a1302df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1, 3, 2,-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"73\" height=\"16\" /> and add them up to get the sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/8/79812fd9a09e7c6ae74dd56c36106638edc816aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) } 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"56\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME\" title=\"1975 AHSME\">1975 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1975 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1975\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"